statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡡᢏᡀᢦ᠀ᡜᠰᡖᡜᡭᢓᢐᡜᢒᡓᡗᢢᡗᠽᡞᡳᡮᠳ᠐ᡑᢀᡗᡎᡱᡑᠭᢀᠦᠿᡞᡆᢑᢏᠿᢤᡰᢦᠼᡡ᠀᠒ᢑᡳᢑ᠑ᡱᠼᠳᢒᢟᠯᡏᡖᡴᡴᡖᠭᡍᡙᡳᠩᡏᢤᠨᢤᢞᡐᡖᠻᠼᠽᡁᢒᠪᡭᡴᡍᡓᢀᠵᢟ</div>"},{"id":"marker68","name":"Ephos Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ቀፀጰጠ በተሀለጠገዐሠየወ ጰሀቀነገደ ከአበሰረነከኀተደፀአአጸ ቀሐሠለሀመ መጠሠፀተሀፐከተበለየዘወፈጠሀጸረአአተረአ ኀዐፈ  አደፐሠከዘ ጠጠለሠጸወቀ ጰጠዘገጠሠፀፀረ</div>"},{"id":"marker69","name":"Budehishah Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༧༈༳༚༡༉༆༑༦༇༴༁༘༙༖༉༦༰༂༷༱༚༖༴༸༹༪༥༉༃༆༂༢༊༛༛༐༧༘༚༅༖༕༿༉༧༨༈༘༄༫༛༔༧༿༐༁༂༚༨༔༊༗༱༪༈༛༦༴༵༯༊༡༒༷༷༗༫༱༽༤༖༔ༀ༧༁༆༸༾༕༘༠༠༨༒༦་༴༕</div>"},{"id":"marker70","name":"Hasar Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ተ  ሠፀጸአቀሐከጸነየገደአዘዐነዘኀሀከፀለሀ  ረ መመፐዘበሀዐደ ፈለየከኀበነተአለአጰከዘፐ  ደዐረዘ ሰአለሐኀጰዐጸበተሐጰፐከሰፀ</div>"},{"id":"marker71","name":"Saion Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳍ⳥ⳬⳠⳞ⳧ⳊⳤⳘ ⳞⳲⲺ⳥⳾ⳭⳈⲴⳢⳁⳢⲾⳈⲾ ⳖⳠⳈⳒⲸ⳾ⳫⳭ Ⳁ⳪ⳘⳒⳁ⳪ⳘⳈⳖⲴⳲⳈⳘⳔⲺⳈⲶⳢⳔⳫⲼⳊ</div>"},{"id":"marker72","name":"Jowshad Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳎⳭⳲ⳩ⳜⳐⳠⳬⳒ⳪Ⲹ ⳾ⳫⳫⳀⲼⲲ⳹ⲾⲸⲾⳚⳊⳆⳎⳘⲲⳂ⳩ⳔⳬⳫ⳪⳪ⳜⲴⳚⳁ ⳬⳄⳜⳊⳜⲸ⳩⳹⳾ⲶⳂⳖⳢⳜⲸⲶⳁⳲⳁⳖⳎⳂⳔⳐ ⲸⳎⳞⳆ</div>"},{"id":"marker73","name":"Sasan Bak Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠩\udc15\ud802\ud802 \udc27\ud802𐠮𐠐\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍𐠪𐠚\udc0b\ud802𐠑 \udc33\udc24𐠞𐠲\ud802  𐠼\udc1e\udc23\udc08𐠦\udc30\udc13\ud802𐠗\udc21𐠷\ud802\ud802𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠰\udc35\udc22\udc34\ud802\ud802𐠦\udc1a\ud802\ud802𐠙𐠵𐠮\ud802 \udc1a\udc3c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠴\udc0c\ud802𐠩𐠠\udc23\udc2e\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker74","name":"Echeh Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༖༵༗༩༄༖༨༶༩༌༼༃༬༷༆༗༒༳༂༻༻༇༵༕༣༓༠༉༆༭༭༊༡༑༣༒༠༒༼༵༌༡༶༶༳༒</div>"},{"id":"marker75","name":"Sarand Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༼་༲༚༫༢༵༙༛༁༿༵༯༐༐༁༷༾༨༸༮༸༵༷༊༒༩༇༬༛༨༰༰༴་༸༌༴༻༚༊༹༰༻༛༛༥༛༿༛༽༻༅༮་༬ༀ༔༫༶༆༱༔༄ༀ༡༶༵༊༓༦༸༣</div>"},{"id":"marker76","name":"Mankadama Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በዐሰገ ጠፐጸወፐፐዘረኀፐጰከሀሐ ሐዘገደነየሰሐቀረነየገተፐየየ ዘፐገየመበአመደጰመ ጠመዐበበለየሀሐፐመጠኀበበየጸየበፈጰጰደፈሀወጠ ለደቀሠዐፐየበገ ጸጸሰቀጸዐጠፀጠፐ</div>"},{"id":"marker77","name":"Nafarand Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በዘሰፀየከገዐረ ቀፐሠሠጰገሰ ፀበጰ ተደአተጸረረደሰወ አአጸደገሰተደደ  ረገገቀ አፀበጸመቀበፀፀደአገፈለኀጠሠሠወቀመአቀኀሠነተወሰየአለሐገ ደጰተፀየጰገጰየነፐነሐጸ ፀ</div>"},{"id":"marker78","name":"Lefka Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc01𐠙\udc0b\udc31\udc2c𐠔𐠳𐠊\udc01\udc30\ud802\ud802𐠗\udc20\udc14 𐠝𐠣\ud802𐠸\udc1a \udc25𐠱\ud802\ud802𐠚𐠈\udc22\udc18\udc29𐠩\udc05\ud802𐠨\udc2e\udc33\udc11\udc20\udc0c\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker79","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Nigiriya Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Codurum Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of speed in Codurum, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Ganji Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Ganji, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Bushian River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Jaguars migration","legend":"A huge group of jaguars are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Neyamin festival","legend":"A festival has been organised at Neyamin as a chance to gather the foreign dignitaries of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Jabad Chasm","legend":"The Jabad Chasm. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Nymphesmos Tomb","legend":"An eerie necropolis where nature intertwines with death. Overgrown tombstones are entwined by thorny vines, and mournful spirits wander among the fading petals of once-vibrant flowers."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/7770\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker106","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/14699\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker107","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4054\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker108","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=