ift in this area is causing all known nearby beings to flee in terror."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Linionos Necropolis","legend":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Ancient Rift","legend":"A rumoured ancient rift in this area is causing swarms of foes to spill forth."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker152","name":"Akrolis Necropolis","legend":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"id":"marker154","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=14968\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=14968\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker155","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=14987\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=14987\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"regiment1-0","name":"1st (Holuakia) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 409 Altondal Era during the Shahr Invasion. 1st (Holuakia) Regiment is stationed in Wanonopi. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 AE:\r\n— infantry: 617\r\n— cavalry: 322\r\n— archers: 330."},{"id":"regiment1-1","name":"2nd (New Kaiehia) Regiment","lege